## Streaming

```python
# Token-level streaming (for WebSocket/SSE to frontend)
async for event in app.astream_events(input_data, config=config, version="v2"):
    if event["event"] == "on_chat_model_stream":
        token = event["data"]["chunk"].content
        await websocket.send_json({"type": "token", "content": token})

# Node-level streaming (intermediate results)
async for chunk in app.astream(input_data, config=config):
    for node_name, node_output in chunk.items():
        await websocket.send_json({"type": "node_output", "node": node_name, "data": node_output})
```

